  "bodyHash": "UCwibrFSvVg=",
  "content": "Hello World<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 30px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1020320292012298300/discord_header2.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 90px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>我們是星蟲騎術模組（SWEM）！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em><strong>全面升級Minecraft中的騎術元素：模型、馬具、動畫、盔甲、裝飾。應有盡有，未來還將持續擴充！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #993300;\"><em><strong>詳細資訊、建議與疑問，請查看下方劇透內容，或造訪我們的Wiki與Discord！</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #993300;\"><em><strong>回報錯誤請至我們的Github。</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #ff6600;\"><em><strong>--------- 此模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files/4052293\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GECKOLIB</a> 3.0.100+ 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\">PLAYERANIMATOR</a> 0.3.5+1.16.5 ---------</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\">當前版本：1.16.5，第一階段 [FORGE]</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1019996251326001172/2022-09-08_23.21.26-removebg-preview_1_1.png\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021033698126209054/1-removebg-preview.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">我們的</span><span style=\"color: #ff9900; text-decoration: underline;\"><b>★ <span style=\"color: #000000; text-decoration: underline;\">新增遊戲內容：</span></b></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✮ 自訂模型與<strong>動畫</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ 獨立的<strong>步態</strong>系統！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ <strong>訓練</strong>與培養羈絆</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ 多種顏色變體與完整的實用<strong>英式、西部與冒險馬具</strong>套裝！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;✧ <em>包括：韁繩、馬鞍、肚帶、馬毯、護腿、耳罩、胸帶！另有馬鞍架、韁繩架與盔甲架。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ <strong>牧場馬毯</strong>與16色裝甲牧場馬毯！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ 遊戲內含112種毛色！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;✧ <em>從栗色、灰色到斑塊等等……還有秘密？</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ 附有翅膀的實用<strong>盔甲</strong>，外加更多裝飾性馬匹盔甲（飛行功能尚未實裝）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ <strong>馬駒</strong>系統</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">✮ <strong>飲食與飲水系統</strong>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;✧ <em>實用的餵食器、水桶與水槽</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✮<strong> 馬廄門</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✮ <strong>以及更多……</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 120px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1020002728388341850/2022-09-08_23.25.19-removebg-preview_1.png\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 180px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1020342977027125268/2022-09-08_23.35.59-removebg-preview_1.png\" width=\"451\" height=\"170\" /></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1063801393644830730/4.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021033697601933413/2-removebg-preview.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><em><strong>以下是我們部分（非全部）自訂馬匹模型與玩家的動畫展示！</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>慢步</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/738913921871904829/1020049466490900572/walkswem.gif\" width=\"531\" height=\"453\" /></p>\n<p><strong>快步</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/738913921871904829/1020050717114900570/trotswem.gif\" width=\"535\" height=\"456\" /></p>\n<p><strong>跑步</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/738913921871904829/1020051369031381022/canterswem.gif\" width=\"531\" height=\"453\" /></p>\n<p><strong>奔馳</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/738913921871904829/1020052525992386620/gallopswem.gif\" width=\"521\" height=\"445\" /></p>\n<p><strong>我們5級跳躍中的其中一級！</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/738913921871904829/1021197761535807559/jumplvl5swem.gif\" width=\"756\" height=\"401\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1063801393196060762/3.png\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021033697190883361/3-removebg-preview.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>由Redzeal製作，我們改編自《小馬王》的預告片。即將在我們的官方Youtube頻道發布！</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZUU04z9j1TQ\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>來看看Peachy的『我愛SWEM的10個理由』影片！它展示了我們遊戲內的物品、馬具和跳躍障礙，以及如何使用它們！</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iaeEkmGILv8\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Redzeal的SWEM主題RRP系列其中一集！</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VED1VTRu63Y\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Brooke簡單又貼心的SWEM小馬照護指南 &lt;3</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v_bmVz-As0A\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1063801395297407047/2.png\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1044356132619161640/Features__4_-removebg-preview.png\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>歡迎提出合併請求。如需重大變更，請先開啟議題討論您想要修改的內容。</strong></p>\n<p><em>點擊圖示前往SWE/M的Github！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/AlaharranHonor/SWEquestrianM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://logos-world.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/GitHub-Logo.png\" alt=\"GitHub Logo, symbol, meaning, history, PNG, brand\" width=\"180\" height=\"101\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1044356124712911019/Untitled_design_-_2022-11-21T205747.958.png\" width=\"881\" height=\"220\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021033696775651409/4-removebg-preview.png\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>問：你們會停留在1.16.5嗎？會向下移植到1.12或更新到1.18以上嗎？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>我們目前停留在1.16.5，但很快就會開始進行1.18的開發，並可能因應未來任何更新。但由於一系列開發相關的衝突與因素，我們不會向下移植到1.12。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：會有這個模組的伺服器嗎？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>會的，我們正在且將會持續開發一個官方伺服器與模組包。想聽到相關更新消息，請務必加入我們下方連結的Discord，或透過我們的網站持續關注進度。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：請問我可以擁有一個自訂毛色嗎？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>我們將開始接受遊戲內自訂毛色的委託。費用尚未確定，請加入我們的Discord以了解更多。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：我對這個模組有個建議！該如何聯繫你們？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>在我們的Discord中，有一個專屬的建議頻道。您還可以在那裡搜尋先前的建議，以及我們計劃如何處理這些建議。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：什麼是階段？我們目前處於哪個階段？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>第一階段是我們的<strong>冒險發布版</strong>。專注於全面升級生存模式中的馬匹相關內容：馬匹模型、毛色、動畫、技能等級、馬廄照護、訓練裝備、馬匹盔甲和騎術裝飾。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 第二階段是我們的<strong>英式/西部發布版</strong>。專注於為騎術伺服器增添更多美好事物和升級內容：更多馬鞍、更多馬具、更多馬匹模型、更多動畫、更多裝飾、更多毛色、繁殖與遺傳、疾病系統以及更多選項。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 第三階段是我們的<strong>降臨發布版</strong>。有人提到<em>魔法</em>嗎？最大也是最後的發布版將完全以冒險為基礎，包含預先建置的維度、背景故事、探索層次、全新方塊、全新生物與神話馬匹，以及等待被發現的新事物。</p>\n<p>.</p>\n<p><strong>問：我該如何捐贈？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>您可以透過我們的 <span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.ko-fi.com/swem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ko-fi</a></span> 或模組擁有者的 <span style=\"color: #3366ff;\"><a style=\"color: #3366ff;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swem/settings/paypal.me/hannturpinswem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PayPal</a></span> 捐款以支持開發與團隊。更多關於捐款方式及其用途/優惠的資訊，請查看我們Discord中的「如何協助」頻道 &lt;3</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>問：我要如何下載模組？這個模組有哪些前置需求？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>請使用Google或Youtube查詢如何下載Forge與模組。這個模組需要geckolib與playeranimator。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/737144919717707896/1007696884653113436/htrdj.gif\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1063801394135584789/5.png\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021892455194427442/Features__1_-removebg-preview.png\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333333;\"><strong><em>製作人員：</em></strong></span><br /><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;擁有者與製作總監&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br /><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;開發者&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>Legenden（主要開發者）<br /><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;素材與紋理&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>SWE/M 紋理與模型美術團隊<br /><em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;完整製作人員名單請見網站。</em></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333333;\"><em><strong>權利：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SWE/M 旗下&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>版權所有<br /><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;程式碼&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>如果您希望獲得程式碼方面的協助，或想協助SWE/M，請與我們聯繫！我們不對公眾開放，但仍樂於幫助其他程式設計師！<br /><br /></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #333333;\"><em><strong>模組包與影片：</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;我可以在我的模組包中使用它嗎？&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span><strong>可以！</strong>無需標示來源，但請聯繫我們，這樣我們也能一起遊玩！<br /><span style=\"color: #333333;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;我可以製作使用SWEM的影片嗎？ &nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;當然可以！</strong></span>請告知我們，以便我們為社群分享宣傳！</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>-----&gt; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #003300;\"><em>別忘了，星蟲照明模組與星蟲裝飾模組是專為搭配SWEM模組而設計的！</em></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 120px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swdm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021044562120155176/SW_DECO_M__5_-removebg-preview.png\" width=\"303\" height=\"106\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swlm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021044562627674112/SW_DECO_M__4_-removebg-preview.png\" width=\"303\" height=\"106\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1063802471597752411/Untitled_design_62.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><em>&nbsp;隨時關注我們的社群平台，掌握最新資訊！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.discord.gg/swem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://www.freepnglogos.com/uploads/discord-logo-png/discord-logo-logodownload-download-logotipos-1.png\" alt=\"Discord Logo Png - Free Transparent PNG Logos\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/StarWormEquestrian\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1384/1384060.png\" alt=\"Youtube - Free social media icons\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.swequestrian.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://www.freepnglogos.com/uploads/logo-website-png/logo-website-file-globe-icon-svg-wikimedia-commons-21.png\" alt=\"Website Logo PNG, Web Site Logos Free Download - Free Transparent PNG Logos\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/starwormequestrian/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Instagram_icon.png/2048px-Instagram_icon.png\" alt=\"File:Instagram icon.png - Wikimedia Commons\" width=\"53\" height=\"53\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swem/settings/discord.gg/swem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><br /><br /><br /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021038522783776808/2022-09-18_13.40.52-removebg-preview.png\" width=\"393\" height=\"182\" /><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/855104943287304222/1021353552003735663/Untitled_design__87_-removebg-preview_1.png\" width=\"429\" height=\"177\" /></p>",
